# DC01 — Active Directory Domain Controller Deployment

## Overview

As part of Lab 02 — Azure Networking, a Windows Server 2025 virtual machine was deployed and configured as the primary Active Directory Domain Controller for the Secure Hybrid Cloud Environment.

The objective was to build a functional enterprise-style Windows domain while maintaining network segmentation and restricting direct public access to infrastructure servers.

