# 11. MGMT01 DNS Configuration

Before joining MGMT01 to the domain, DNS was configured to use the domain controller.

MGMT01 was configured to use:

```text
10.10.10.4
```

as its DNS server.

This is necessary because Active Directory relies heavily on DNS service records to locate domain controllers and other domain services.

