# 13. Domain Join

After DNS and network connectivity were confirmed, MGMT01 was joined to:

```text
corp.securecloud.local
```

PowerShell command:

```powershell
Add-Computer -DomainName "corp.securecloud.local" -Credential "CORP\Administrator" -Restart
```

The system restarted automatically after the domain join.

