# 14. Credential Troubleshooting

An initial domain-join authentication failure occurred because the distinction between local and domain credentials needed to be established.

### Local Account

The following format represents a local Windows account:

```text
.\username
```

This authenticates against the local computer.

### Domain Account

The following format represents an Active Directory account:

```text
CORP\Administrator
```

or:

```text
Administrator@corp.securecloud.local
```

These credentials authenticate against the Active Directory domain.

### Resolution

The correct domain credentials were identified and used for the domain join.

MGMT01 successfully restarted after joining the domain.

